# These zips are single ~161MB archives of their same-named folders - they
# exceed both this chat's file-delivery limit and GitHub's 100MB single-file
# push limit, so only the unpacked folders are tracked here. Regenerate
# locally after cloning with, e.g.:
#   cd public_html_ready && zip -r -X ../public_html_ready.zip .
#   cd public_html_ready_2026-07-23 && zip -r -X ../public_html_ready_2026-07-23.zip .
